
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_NONE: number = 1`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_NONE = 1;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_NONE has the value 1</p>
  <p>Used with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_TYPE" target="_blank">PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_TYPE</a>. Prims of this type are ignored by the physics engine. Read more details on <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_TYPE" target="_blank">PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_TYPE</a></p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>PhysicsShapeType</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Notes</h2>
  <p>[](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/File:Physics_shape_none.png)<b>The physics shape type attribute can be found in the Features tab of the Edit window.</b></p>
  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <p>History</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Introduced in <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Release_Notes/Second_Life_RC_LeTigre/11#11.09.09.240509" target="_blank">Second Life RC LeTigre 11.09.09.240509</a>, September 9, 2011</li>
    <li><a href="http://www.sluniverse.com/php/vb/scripting/61203-future-physics-functions-tease.html#post1305775" target="_blank">SLUniverse:Future physics functions tease</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p><a href="https://secondlife.canny.io/?search=PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_NONE" target="_blank">Search Canny for related Issues</a></p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Signature</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`
PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_NONE = 1
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
integer PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_NONE = 1;
`} lang="lsl" /></div>

</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

</DocsLayout>
      